WEBVTT

00:00:00.820 --> 00:00:02.660
Queen's Blade.

00:00:02.660 --> 00:00:05.040
The defeated are left with disgrace and frustration

00:00:05.040 --> 00:00:07.800
while new trials await the victors.

00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:12.230
Whether they advance or turn back, these warriors will face hell.

00:00:12.230 --> 00:00:15.250
These chains of heartless battles awaken the madness within them.

00:00:16.950 --> 00:00:24.000
The sky will not fall, the sea will not dry, and the earth will not split.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:30.630
I am prepared to offer my life.

00:00:38.890 --> 00:00:44.060
Just as I can see no end to this sky,

00:00:44.520 --> 00:00:50.980
I inherit the will and strength that will exist forever.

00:00:52.240 --> 00:00:57.320
With each person carrying different feelings in their heart,

00:00:57.320 --> 00:01:05.040
When the time comes, they will fulfill their promise with that special someone.

00:01:05.420 --> 00:01:09.460
In order to become

00:01:09.460 --> 00:01:14.630
the chosen ruler of this world,

00:01:14.630 --> 00:01:18.720
I will shake off any pain I feel.

00:01:18.720 --> 00:01:25.980
The sky will not fall, the sea will not drought, and the earth will not split.

00:01:25.980 --> 00:01:32.020
I am prepared to offer my life.

00:01:32.780 --> 00:01:39.030
No one shall stop me on my path.

00:02:22.650 --> 00:02:23.680
My Count...

00:02:23.680 --> 00:02:25.900
Please hurry and escape from the city.

00:02:25.900 --> 00:02:29.780
I wish to see what the Queen is planning here.

00:02:29.780 --> 00:02:31.500
Send out the army, as planned.

00:02:31.500 --> 00:02:31.970
Yes.

00:02:34.210 --> 00:02:35.920
General Claudette.

00:02:35.920 --> 00:02:39.640
It is time to show your strength to Aldra.

00:02:55.020 --> 00:02:56.630
Onee-chan, big trouble!

00:03:03.670 --> 00:03:04.740
Onee-chan!

00:03:05.150 --> 00:03:06.180
Onee-chan.

00:03:06.180 --> 00:03:07.510
Wake up, already!

00:03:19.830 --> 00:03:22.060
I'm coming in.

00:03:38.440 --> 00:03:39.320
Who?!

00:03:41.380 --> 00:03:42.700
It's me!

00:03:42.700 --> 00:03:44.230
Geez!

00:03:45.220 --> 00:03:47.690
Elina, where are you touching me?

00:03:47.690 --> 00:03:50.150
Well, you wouldn't wake up.

00:03:50.150 --> 00:03:52.650
Anyway, they sure are soft.

00:03:52.650 --> 00:03:54.750
They're so bouncy, just like pudding!

00:03:54.750 --> 00:03:57.600
Ah, I want to eat them already!

00:03:57.600 --> 00:03:59.030
Geez!

00:03:59.030 --> 00:04:01.670
What are you doing? Stop it!

00:04:03.250 --> 00:04:04.710
Wait, Elina!

00:04:04.710 --> 00:04:06.970
That's right! There's big trouble.

00:04:11.220 --> 00:04:13.760
That person's stance remains unchanged.

00:04:16.190 --> 00:04:17.080
Come!

00:04:28.630 --> 00:04:30.200
Vance castle...

00:04:30.200 --> 00:04:31.270
Why?

00:04:31.270 --> 00:04:32.200
I know, right?

00:04:56.000 --> 00:04:57.810
Thunder Shock!

00:05:12.620 --> 00:05:16.440
Ah! The water fountain that Onee-chan has so many precious memories of is...

00:05:16.440 --> 00:05:19.380
That monkey! If anything else happens, I'll kill her!

00:05:21.490 --> 00:05:23.080
Both of them are amazing.

00:05:34.550 --> 00:05:35.270
This person...

00:05:37.400 --> 00:05:38.990
Her vigor...

00:05:38.990 --> 00:05:40.480
strength...

00:05:40.480 --> 00:05:42.750
and her fearless, machinelike attacks...

00:05:43.420 --> 00:05:46.150
She didn't fight like this before.

00:05:49.190 --> 00:05:53.080
However, no matter who you are, I will not lose!

00:06:11.340 --> 00:06:13.500
Thunderclap Strike!

00:06:24.020 --> 00:06:25.290
Splendid.

00:06:28.210 --> 00:06:30.060
I knew Onee-sama was strong!

00:06:30.060 --> 00:06:34.870
Thank goodness. Now your place of memories won't be destroyed anymore, right?

00:06:34.870 --> 00:06:36.360
Right, Onee-chan?

00:06:45.000 --> 00:06:46.250
What a splendid performance.

00:06:47.970 --> 00:06:51.360
Allowing the opponent to come close is a magnificent way to fight.

00:06:52.100 --> 00:06:53.890
I am honored.

00:06:54.570 --> 00:06:57.050
I wonder what they're talking about.

00:06:57.050 --> 00:06:57.660
Yeah...

00:07:01.070 --> 00:07:03.770
We will now move towards subjugating the Queen.

00:07:04.400 --> 00:07:07.120
You will join our forces...

00:07:07.120 --> 00:07:08.710
General Claudette.

00:07:15.630 --> 00:07:16.940
Are you prepared?

00:07:19.640 --> 00:07:21.390
Please wait, Count.

00:07:24.510 --> 00:07:25.840
If I may have a word...

00:07:25.840 --> 00:07:31.620
Subjugating the Queen after all this time is nothing more than an arbitrary decision.

00:07:31.620 --> 00:07:33.370
Do you think...

00:07:33.370 --> 00:07:37.230
Do you think the people will obtain happiness this way?

00:07:39.710 --> 00:07:40.960
Count...

00:07:40.960 --> 00:07:42.690
please withdraw the army.

00:07:42.690 --> 00:07:46.040
From this moment onwards, I will continue to win the Queen's Blade battles.

00:07:46.040 --> 00:07:48.110
I will become Queen.

00:07:48.110 --> 00:07:50.060
And when I hold that title, I will rule everything-

00:07:50.060 --> 00:07:51.400
You fool.

00:07:51.400 --> 00:07:53.860
There is no meaning to you becoming Queen.

00:07:56.190 --> 00:07:58.660
The problem lies with Queen's Blade itself,

00:07:58.660 --> 00:08:02.500
if we don't overthrow the Queen, this continent will have no future.

00:08:05.250 --> 00:08:06.420
Maria-sama!

00:08:07.950 --> 00:08:10.270
It seems to me...

00:08:10.270 --> 00:08:16.180
that you won't let go of the grief and hatred of being robbed of Maria-sama.

00:08:18.350 --> 00:08:21.110
How dare you speak to me like that!

00:08:21.110 --> 00:08:23.610
You still do not realize it!?

00:08:25.100 --> 00:08:30.480
Your stubbornness is what drove Maria-sama to Queen's Blade!

00:08:46.750 --> 00:08:50.810
What do you know about Maria?!

00:08:52.030 --> 00:08:54.740
Just before Maria-sama began her journey...

00:08:54.740 --> 00:08:58.260
I was able to talk to her once, when I was young.

00:09:03.130 --> 00:09:04.350
Ah, you are...

00:09:06.220 --> 00:09:07.670
It's all right.

00:09:07.670 --> 00:09:10.410
Come here, Claudette.

00:09:10.410 --> 00:09:14.740
We aren't related by blood, but you are a daughter of the Vance family.

00:09:18.020 --> 00:09:20.450
This may burden you with hardships from now on,

00:09:20.450 --> 00:09:24.500
but I am leaving your father and his daughters in your care.

00:09:24.500 --> 00:09:26.530
Maria-sama...

00:09:29.910 --> 00:09:32.660
If I do not return...

00:09:33.770 --> 00:09:36.780
If I do not return from Queen's Blade...

00:09:36.780 --> 00:09:41.090
please help him overcome his suffering.

00:09:41.090 --> 00:09:42.350
Suffering?

00:09:42.350 --> 00:09:46.880
Yes, from the 120 years of Vance's suffering.

00:09:49.890 --> 00:09:54.360
Henceforth, I will devote myself to serving the Vance family, as well as the Count.

00:09:54.990 --> 00:10:01.480
Protecting the family honor according to Maria-sama's words in order to offer you relief from your suffering.

00:10:03.240 --> 00:10:07.260
However, I've finally realized it through Queen's Blade.

00:10:07.260 --> 00:10:11.190
Maria-sama's wish, what she was longing for...

00:10:12.870 --> 00:10:16.760
Vance's glory is their curse, and the cause of your suffering.

00:10:17.560 --> 00:10:21.660
Maria-sama was attempting to become Queen to relieve you from this!

00:10:23.970 --> 00:10:26.140
Then I ask...

00:10:26.140 --> 00:10:30.060
Will you kill Queen Aldra in Queen's Blade?

00:10:31.520 --> 00:10:32.570
Answer me!

00:10:35.490 --> 00:10:40.460
If you fail to kill the Queen, our army will also fail in their mission.

00:10:43.740 --> 00:10:45.080
That is enough!

00:10:45.540 --> 00:10:48.250
I need not invest any more time in this.

00:10:48.670 --> 00:10:51.750
Never show yourself in front of me again!

00:11:01.100 --> 00:11:02.050
Count!

00:11:34.470 --> 00:11:36.750
She's aiming for the Count?!

00:11:38.670 --> 00:11:40.860
Thunderclap Strike!

00:11:45.220 --> 00:11:47.200
Count, hurry outside the castle!

00:12:24.270 --> 00:12:26.710
Thunderclap Strike!

00:12:30.630 --> 00:12:33.330
It's about time to bring this to an end.

00:13:27.980 --> 00:13:30.430
Count, are you hurt?

00:13:30.430 --> 00:13:31.860
Claudette...

00:13:45.080 --> 00:13:49.380
Victor: Leader of the Kiba, Risty.

00:13:50.970 --> 00:13:52.880
No way!

00:13:52.880 --> 00:13:54.570
Onee-sama!

00:13:54.570 --> 00:13:55.840
Father!

00:14:00.300 --> 00:14:01.800
Claudette.

00:14:01.800 --> 00:14:02.820
Claudette!

00:14:06.900 --> 00:14:09.620
Count, I'm glad you're unharmed.

00:14:09.620 --> 00:14:11.440
Thanks to your help.

00:14:11.440 --> 00:14:14.270
Forgive me for questioning your loyalty.

00:14:15.500 --> 00:14:16.790
We'll get you out immediately.

00:14:18.270 --> 00:14:21.140
I was able to save you...

00:14:21.140 --> 00:14:24.210
Have I made you proud?

00:14:24.210 --> 00:14:25.710
Clo...

00:14:26.320 --> 00:14:27.630
I...

00:14:27.630 --> 00:14:33.930
I just wanted set you free from the Vance family's curse.

00:14:33.930 --> 00:14:35.810
That's all.

00:14:37.070 --> 00:14:39.540
Like Maria-sama wanted.

00:14:44.730 --> 00:14:45.820
Claudette.

00:14:48.360 --> 00:14:50.140
My daughter!

00:14:55.420 --> 00:14:56.750
Father.

00:15:19.800 --> 00:15:22.350
So Vance still lives?

00:15:22.350 --> 00:15:24.820
However, I have achieved my objective.

00:15:24.820 --> 00:15:27.510
It would be careless to chase them any further.

00:15:27.510 --> 00:15:28.740
No good!

00:15:28.740 --> 00:15:32.820
In the end, humans are weak creatures. That's all there is to it.

00:15:32.820 --> 00:15:34.120
You can't help but laugh at them.

00:15:52.150 --> 00:15:53.590
Onee-sama...

00:15:54.970 --> 00:15:56.450
actually lost.

00:16:05.430 --> 00:16:06.580
Onee-sama!

00:16:06.580 --> 00:16:07.400
We have to treat her quickly!

00:16:10.610 --> 00:16:11.690
Onee-sama.

00:16:12.650 --> 00:16:16.970
What a relief. I wouldn't know what to do if you were gone...

00:16:18.730 --> 00:16:19.790
Leina.

00:16:19.790 --> 00:16:20.880
Yes.

00:16:21.840 --> 00:16:23.590
Risty is...

00:16:23.590 --> 00:16:26.430
not the opponent you know anymore.

00:16:27.290 --> 00:16:31.120
She'll certainly be aiming for your life.

00:16:31.120 --> 00:16:33.140
Directly, and without hesitation.

00:16:35.680 --> 00:16:40.210
You must deal with her carefully. Understand?

00:16:45.190 --> 00:16:46.940
This way, this way!

00:16:46.940 --> 00:16:49.340
Yes! Right away!

00:16:51.030 --> 00:16:53.940
Hey, did you hear that rumor?

00:16:53.940 --> 00:16:58.160
Oh, you're talking about the monster that appeared? The one with horns on its head?

00:16:58.160 --> 00:17:01.040
Yeah, that one! Isn't that strange?

00:17:01.040 --> 00:17:03.160
A monster with horns on its head?

00:17:03.160 --> 00:17:05.560
How long are you gonna make me wait? Hey!

00:17:05.560 --> 00:17:06.490
R-Right away!

00:17:10.110 --> 00:17:12.160
Ouch!

00:17:13.720 --> 00:17:15.510
Stupid wench!

00:17:15.510 --> 00:17:18.680
What are you spilling?! What a waste!

00:17:19.770 --> 00:17:22.090
I'm sorry!

00:17:50.120 --> 00:17:53.500
Ahh! What a nice fragrance!

00:17:53.500 --> 00:17:58.050
I'm happy to hear that. I bought various pleasant teas for you to try.

00:17:59.770 --> 00:18:01.550
Please try it, Melona-san.

00:18:01.560 --> 00:18:03.040
Ah, yes.

00:18:05.350 --> 00:18:06.690
This is delicious.

00:18:06.690 --> 00:18:07.640
I'm glad.

00:18:07.640 --> 00:18:10.640
Say, why do I have to have tea with <i>her</i>?

00:18:10.640 --> 00:18:14.130
She is your friend after all, Nanael-sama.

00:18:14.130 --> 00:18:16.960
There's no way an angel would be friends with a monster!

00:18:16.960 --> 00:18:18.280
You should say something about this, too!

00:18:18.280 --> 00:18:20.580
Don't be like that. Isn't it fine?

00:18:20.580 --> 00:18:22.320
Let's leave that aside.

00:18:22.320 --> 00:18:25.000
Speaking of which, what did you come here for?

00:18:25.000 --> 00:18:26.110
Eh?

00:18:26.110 --> 00:18:30.790
Oh, there's something about the Queen that piqued my interest.

00:18:32.310 --> 00:18:35.710
Eh!? You're saying that Aldra isn't human!?

00:18:35.710 --> 00:18:41.580
Would an ordinary human's eye shine and turn the object of their gaze into stone?

00:18:41.580 --> 00:18:43.710
That may be impossible.

00:18:43.710 --> 00:18:45.770
That's absolutely impossible!

00:18:45.890 --> 00:18:47.890
Cattleya, who lost her fight,

00:18:47.890 --> 00:18:50.070
Menace and Setra,

00:18:50.070 --> 00:18:53.230
It seems that Nyx's staff, Funikura, was turned to stone, as well.

00:18:53.230 --> 00:18:58.030
But the strange thing is that she was planning
to turn Airi to stone as well, after she had won.

00:18:58.030 --> 00:19:03.580
Oh, I thought for sure that that maid was just talking nonsense at the time...

00:19:03.580 --> 00:19:07.060
You were almost killed, too.

00:19:07.060 --> 00:19:08.580
Eh? Really?

00:19:08.580 --> 00:19:14.320
That must have been because the Queen was so frightened by my greatness, she couldn't mess with me!

00:19:15.780 --> 00:19:17.710
That must have been the archangel's great authority.

00:19:19.920 --> 00:19:20.890
But say...

00:19:21.870 --> 00:19:24.580
That big-breasted merchant woman was human.

00:19:24.580 --> 00:19:27.350
So she shouldn't have been turned to stone after losing.

00:19:27.350 --> 00:19:29.460
Regarding that, I have no clue.

00:19:29.460 --> 00:19:32.680
It seems that Cattleya's husband was turned to stone quite some time ago.

00:19:32.680 --> 00:19:34.060
Really?

00:19:34.060 --> 00:19:37.110
Come to think of it, did the Head Angel say something like that before?

00:19:37.110 --> 00:19:41.290
"Queen Aldra is completely different from the queens who preceded her."

00:19:41.290 --> 00:19:46.030
"Even now, I cannot determine whether she is a human or a demon."

00:19:46.030 --> 00:19:50.430
Well, even the Head Angel couldn't tell, so of course <i>we'd</i> be having trouble.

00:19:50.430 --> 00:19:52.520
So she's of the demon family, after all?

00:19:52.520 --> 00:19:54.990
Well, I don't know about that...

00:19:56.400 --> 00:19:59.380
A demon wouldn't have been so afraid of something like that.

00:19:59.380 --> 00:20:01.790
Without it, I wouldn't have been able to come back.

00:20:01.790 --> 00:20:03.140
That's where the problem lies.

00:20:04.360 --> 00:20:06.850
You say she's afraid of divine milk...

00:20:06.850 --> 00:20:08.350
Could it be...

00:20:11.060 --> 00:20:13.190
What? Do you know something?

00:20:13.190 --> 00:20:14.010
Eh?

00:20:14.470 --> 00:20:17.180
I won't tell a demon like you!

00:20:18.320 --> 00:20:19.900
Well then, thanks for treating me.

00:20:21.880 --> 00:20:26.300
Damn it.... what was that about? Just what did she want?

00:20:26.300 --> 00:20:27.280
Melpha! Another cup!

00:20:27.830 --> 00:20:28.670
Right away!

00:20:30.940 --> 00:20:35.070
It seems like that idiot angel knows something, after all.

00:20:40.300 --> 00:20:42.050
It's gone, gone, gone, gone!

00:20:42.050 --> 00:20:45.640
It isn't here either! It's completely vanished!

00:20:45.640 --> 00:20:50.310
That soft and flabby pink bitch! She was after the divine milk from the start?

00:20:50.310 --> 00:20:53.730
I'll be done for at this rate!

00:21:05.040 --> 00:21:07.030
She was called Melona, wasn't she?

00:21:07.030 --> 00:21:09.160
That subordinate of the Swamp Witch.

00:21:10.240 --> 00:21:14.410
Ah, the monster who escaped from here.

00:21:14.410 --> 00:21:17.580
She will probably come here...

00:21:17.580 --> 00:21:21.210
to rescue her partner.

00:21:21.210 --> 00:21:22.830
We'll deal with her again.

00:21:23.900 --> 00:21:26.520
That's why you don't have to worry.

00:21:26.520 --> 00:21:30.760
I'll protect your future for all eternity.

00:21:30.760 --> 00:21:32.630
My beloved Aldra.

00:21:44.440 --> 00:21:48.620
I wonder in what a heart throbbing way I should make you mero - mero!

00:21:48.620 --> 00:21:50.910
I'm having fun already just by thinking about it.

00:21:50.910 --> 00:21:54.410
I'll show you all that I'm the luckiest one in the end.

00:21:54.410 --> 00:21:57.790
So everyone! Let's fight until we're all melted.

00:21:58.500 --> 00:22:00.540
Swamp Witch.

00:22:00.540 --> 00:22:02.250
An eerie existence.

00:22:02.250 --> 00:22:03.940
Well, we're all girls of the underworld.

00:22:03.940 --> 00:22:05.920
Majestic orders.

00:22:05.920 --> 00:22:07.550
Oh, Swamp Witch.

00:22:07.550 --> 00:22:09.070
Such erotic actions.

00:22:09.070 --> 00:22:10.580
We'll truly show our love for you.

00:22:10.580 --> 00:22:11.310
Yes.

00:22:11.310 --> 00:22:13.790
The three of us will all serve you.

00:22:13.790 --> 00:22:14.540
Really?

00:22:14.540 --> 00:22:15.430
Most likely.

00:22:15.430 --> 00:22:17.630
Girls, let's all do our jobs properly.

00:22:18.270 --> 00:22:20.610
Melona is oh so cute.

00:22:20.610 --> 00:22:23.030
She's the bunny-eared shape shifter.

00:22:23.030 --> 00:22:25.440
Calm, serene, and logical,

00:22:25.440 --> 00:22:27.860
You have no time to look away from me.

00:22:27.860 --> 00:22:30.200
If you want me to play with you,

00:22:30.200 --> 00:22:32.620
You can't do anything half-heartedly.

00:22:32.620 --> 00:22:34.410
If you can't excite me,

00:22:34.410 --> 00:22:37.540
You're not fit to be my plaything.

00:22:37.910 --> 00:22:42.450
Will you regret playing with me?

00:22:42.670 --> 00:22:50.050
You're always hesitating to become my plaything.

00:22:50.260 --> 00:22:52.890
I have an erotic body,

00:22:52.890 --> 00:22:55.770
And can capture your heart with shape attacks.

00:22:55.770 --> 00:22:57.850
I'm acidic and acidic,

00:22:57.850 --> 00:22:59.980
I can transform any time.

00:22:59.980 --> 00:23:02.650
No matter who the person, I'll use my body,

00:23:02.650 --> 00:23:05.280
And melt them down to their last remaining bit.

00:23:05.280 --> 00:23:07.400
I'm a being beyond your comprehension,

00:23:07.400 --> 00:23:10.070
These pink bunny-ears make me the best.

00:23:13.330 --> 00:23:15.290
Hello, hello! It's Nanael-san!

00:23:15.290 --> 00:23:17.120
I've returned to my rightful place!

00:23:17.120 --> 00:23:20.840
Things have calmed down. Without flabby pink around, it sure is peaceful, isn't it?

00:23:22.920 --> 00:23:25.130
Oh! I was too relaxed and fell asleep!

00:23:25.130 --> 00:23:27.510
Before I knew, she had stolen
my precious bottle of divine milk!

00:23:27.510 --> 00:23:30.010
All because I was completely deceived by the flabby pink!

00:23:30.010 --> 00:23:32.970
If this goes on, I'll receive a horrible punishment from the Head Angel!

00:23:32.970 --> 00:23:34.000
That's how it is!

00:23:34.000 --> 00:23:36.260
Next time: Cherished Desire! Reason for Fighting.

00:23:36.260 --> 00:23:39.630
The heated battles of Queen's Blade are heavily weighted by a great cause.

00:23:39.630 --> 00:23:42.240
Nanael-san, time for a tactical retreat!
